              </a>
            </li>
            <li id="source-7">
              OWASP GenAI Security Project, “Top 10 for LLM Applications 2025,”
              2024,{" "}
              <a href="https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-llm-applications-2025/">
