              </a>
            </li>
            <li id="source-8">
              Verizon Business, “2025 Data Breach Investigations Report,” April
              23, 2025,{" "}
              <a href="https://www.verizon.com/about/news/2025-data-breach-investigations-report">
                source
              </a>
            </li>
            <li id="source-9">
              IBM / Ponemon Institute, “Cost of a Data Breach Report 2025,” July
              30, 2025,{" "}
              <a href="https://de.newsroom.ibm.com/2025-07-30-IBM-Studie-Kosten-von-Datenlecks-sinken-in-Deutschland-erstmals-seit-funf-Jahren">
                source
              </a>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
